Prevzaté diela / Third-party works
----------------------------------
Rozhodujúce sú podmienky pôvodcov; strojové prevody do Markdownu slúžia nástroju ako
referenčné texty a pri rozpore platí pôvodný dokument. / The originators' terms govern; the
Markdown conversions serve the tool as reference texts and the original documents prevail.

- references/information-for-all-en.md, -cs.md, -sk.md: Inclusion Europe (with SPMP ČR,
  ZPMP v SR), "Information for all. European standards for making information easy to read
  and understand", https://www.inclusion-europe.eu/ (EN, CZ and SK PDFs). © Inclusion Europe.
- references/easy-to-read-checklist-en.md: Inclusion Europe, "Easy-to-read checklist",
  https://www.inclusion-europe.eu/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/Easy-to-read-checklist-Inclusion-Europe.pdf.
  © Inclusion Europe.
- references/cz-metodika-easy-to-read.md, -priklady.md: Vláda České republiky, Vládní výbor pro
  osoby se zdravotním postižením, "Metodika Easy to Read",
  https://vlada.gov.cz/cz/ppov/vvozp/dokumenty/metodika-easy-to-read-174932/.
- dictionaries/hurraki-sk.json: Slovak adaptation of Hurraki (https://hurraki.de/),
  CC BY-SA 3.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/.
- dictionaries/inclusion-europe-sk.json: Slovak translation of the Inclusion Europe
  easy-to-read dictionary, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0; see the "licence" block in the file.

Pri každom súbore slovníka je rozhodujúci jeho blok "licence". / For every dictionary file,
its own "licence" block governs.
